## Tooling

Default `task_runner` is **just**. Makefile is a shim when
`task_runner` is `makefile` or `both`. Typecheck is **ty**, not mypy. Node
package manager is **pnpm**. Generated `mise.toml` is always-on (Python 3.11,
Node **22**, pnpm, uv). Maintainer `.mise.toml` pins a Node 22 patch.
`openspec_extra` defaults to **disabled** and does not gate mise. 1.x Copier remaps live in
[docs/upgrade-guide.md](docs/upgrade-guide.md); command pointers live in
[AGENTS.md](./AGENTS.md).

| Task | Command |
| ---- | ------- |
| Quality | `{{ _quality_cmd }}`{% if task_runner == 'both' %} or `make quality`{% endif %} |
| Typecheck | `{{ _typecheck_cmd }}` or `uv run ty check` |
| Lint / format | `uv run ruff check` / `uv run ruff format` |
| Python env | `uv sync` (`uv run` for every Python invocation) |
| Node workspace | `pnpm install` |
{% if docs_module == 'enabled' and docs_framework == 'sphinx-shibuya' %}| Sphinx | `uv run sphinx-build python/docs dist/docs` |
{% endif %}{% if docs_module == 'enabled' and docs_framework == 'fumadocs' %}| Fumadocs | `pnpm --filter docs-fumadocs dev` / `build` |
{% endif %}{% if docs_module == 'enabled' and docs_framework == 'docusaurus' %}| Docusaurus | `pnpm --filter docs-docusaurus start` / `build` |
{% endif %}

Do not document `mypy`, `mypy.ini`, or `riso-mcp` as defaults. The removed
maintainer MCP server is not part of this scaffold.
